*.md
!/README.md
test
# Local-only data (e.g. Mendeley datasets with India prices): testing, validation
# and evaluation on this PC only. Never committed, published or used in CI.
/local_only/
/pipelines/tests/fixtures_local/
# ENTSO-E day-ahead prices belong to the exchanges (docs/data/sources/entsoe.md):
# fixtures stay on this PC until publishing rights are confirmed. Tests skip without them.
/pipelines/tests/fixtures/entsoe/
